<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬アラサーバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサー怒り.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is a witch!</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Not in the Arata settlement's sense. A real witch. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was cursed to death by </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">this child</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I flared up and nearly got to my feet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">As if to cut me off, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> spoke up at once.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, tell me more. Why a curse..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, didn't you see?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　When </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> fell, an invisible force twisted his body and he was impaled on the fence. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If he'd fallen normally, at least he wouldn't have hit the fence."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But then <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> would have been crushed under <STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE>, so <STYLE ID="4">he</STYLE> tried to avoid that!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"And you heard that sound, didn't you!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　A sound that loud can't come out of nowhere! That was the witch's power!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　The proof is that since that day </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s had some strange power, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Isn't that the witch's power?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No...! That was <STYLE ID="6">Eiichiro</STYLE>―"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサーうつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"There's no point talking any more. Either way, you have no choice but to do as I say. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I told you things that are strictly secret―the hidden side of the Arata settlement... You understand, don't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If you betray me after coming this far, it won't just be you two. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> won't get off lightly either."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"If I wanted to, I could set 'someone I can trust' or the settlement on you and make you disappear. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The people of the Arata settlement are all timid, after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You know there was no postmark on the letter I sent, right? I had 'someone I can trust' put that letter in your mailbox. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The people of the settlement know where you live."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ngh...!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"One more thing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Long ago, a faction that split off from the Arata settlement founded a cult in Megasawa, I hear. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That cult still exists. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s classmates include a believer too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So here in Megasawa, there are plenty of people connected to the Arata settlement too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Don't even think about running."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Damn! Was this what she was after!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">No matter how we struggled, unless we did as </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> said, not just us but even </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Things had gotten even worse. It was as good as having my family taken hostage...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">I see. Now I understood what </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> meant when she said </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> wasn't stupid.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, once so simple and honest, did everything she could for her </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">daughter</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, she sank this low, into a </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="こうかつ">cunning</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> criminal.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">She had always been a step ahead of us. From the moment we came here, we'd had no choice but to do as </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> said.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Now, let's get some sleep. Early tomorrow morning, I'm going with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to the Arata settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s third-year memorial service..."</STYLE> [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">With that, she turned her back and lay down.</STYLE><PG>
"Then what if you left <STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE> with us for a while...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You mean to take </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> from me...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If you take </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> from me, my reason will snap, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> might end up like that fly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is my family. I'll never hand her over to anyone."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was kneeling formally, head bowed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s wretched life, and the </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> who had changed so much, had come as a real shock to her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">She was no longer the </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> she used to be.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\春花子供バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> slept soundly, not knowing they were right next to each other.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">So that these two could always rest peacefully like this, I still wanted to stop it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">There's still time...!</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
